~ start
Danilo: ...
Danilo: For now, I’ll just head to the hangout first.
Danilo: But... I have to pass through the graveyard on the way.
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(1, "Check the map and go to the graveyard")
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

~ signage
Danilo: So, I'll just have to go straight to the graveyard...
=> END

~ grave_entry
Danilo: [shake]I’m still scared to walk through here alone.[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]But... I have no choice. I need to go through.[/shake]
do Hud.clear_objectives()
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(2, "Find the small hut")
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

~ smallhut_lock
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
Danilo: Locked? ...It wasn’t locked before.
Danilo: Where could the key be?
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(3, "Look around to get clues")
=> END

~ no_key
Danilo: I need to find the key first to open this.
=> END

~ unknown_sender_clue
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Ano ba unang nadaanan mo?")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]What did you pass first?
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Doon mo hanapin ang susi upang mabuksan ang pintuang ‘yan.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Look there for the key to open that door.
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(3)
do Hud.phone_outro()

Danilo: [shake]The key... in the graveyard?[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]I don’t want to linger there.[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]But... I also need the key to open this door.[/shake]
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(4, "Search graveyard to get key")
=> END

