~ paper_found
Danilo: Finally... I found all the pieces.
Danilo: But... it’s hard to piece them together and read them here.
Danilo: I’ll hide them for now and explore the other locations on the map.
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(6)
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(7, "Exit small hut and graveyard")
=> END

~ enter_sala
Danilo: Hangout living room.
Danilo: So dusty in here.
Danilo: The chairs and some boxes are still here.
Danilo: Feels like time hasn’t passed at all.
=> END

~ enter_cr
Danilo: Hangout bathroom.
Danilo: Nothing’s changed.
Danilo: Still unpleasant smelling.
Danilo: What did I expect? No one cleans here.
=> END

~ enter_kusina
Danilo: Hangout kitchen.
Danilo: We used to cook here often.
Danilo: [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color] often invited us to play here too.
Danilo: I thought... maybe he’d become a chef when we grew up.
Danilo: But... he never did.
Danilo: [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color]... I hope we see you again.
Danilo: Cook us with your favorite dishes again.
=> END

~ enter_kwarto2
Danilo: Hangout bedroom.
Danilo: We used to nap here.
Danilo: Me in the middle, Wendy to my right, and [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color] to my left.
Danilo: Sleep felt good... until Mang Gino carried [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color] away.
Danilo: He cried... I don’t know if from fear or pain.
Danilo: Mang Gino always had a stick when he picked him up.
Danilo: I wish I could have done something to protect him.
=> END

~ enter_kwarto1
Danilo: Hangout bedroom.
Danilo: This is where our chase games usually started.
Danilo: Probably the last time we played here before being forbidden.
Danilo: Wendy got hurt... and Lola Ising is very strict.
Danilo: Our parents found out, so we were banned here completely.
Danilo: After that, we could only play with toys.
=> END

